window.products.push({"id":457133,"name":"ELIBABA Cooling Side Sleeper Pillows for Neck and Shoulder Pain Relief Sleeping - Adjustable Cooling Memory Foam Neck Pillow- Curved Bed Pillow with E","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NVf4Ys5IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Tired of neck pain?】Loft alone may not relieve your neck pain, if you find yourself trying to pull traditional rectangular pillows down around your neck. Our side sleeper pillow was designed to fit around the shoulders and neck, cradle the head and lock in that neutral spine alignment. A side sleeper neck pain pillow allows you to slide your shoulders right into the curve and offers a higher loft under your neck. Your head can roll around and be supported in any and every position. 【Cooling effect and breathability】Too sweaty to relax? The top side of the cooling side sleeper pillow's cover is made of proprietary ice silk fabric that feels cool to the touch and perfect for sensitive skin. This material can wick away moisture to keep you comfortable on humid nights. The underside combines natural bamboo with polyester. It's a soft and breathable side that feels luxurious to touch. Our double-sided pillowcases can keep you cooler in summer, but warmer in winter. 【Adjustable height and firmness】If you are someone who wants everything just the way you like it, an adjustable shredded memory foam pillow like this one may be a good fit for you. It comes with an additional pack of memory foam in case you want a firm pillow, or you can remove foam to make a soft pillow. If you don't use all of the memory foam at once, this can also be a great way to make it last longer, as you can add in fresh foam once you feel you want to. 【Premium materials】The bed pillows king size set of 1 for side sleepers has been certified by CertiPUR-US and OEKO-TEX for safety. That means it meets strict third-party standards for health and safety and are both natural and made without any toxins;The eco-friendly materials and green company policy let you sleep easily knowing you're doing your small part for the planet. 【Be assured to buy】 Buying items online can be a daunting task, so we want you to realize that there is absolute ZERO risk in buying something and trying it out. You have 100 nights from the date you receive the king pillow to test it out. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact our service support team. We will try our best to serve you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NVf4Ys5IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELIBABA","source_asin":"B0BZ87KQFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457133","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ87KQFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ87KQFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
