window.products.push({"id":457247,"name":"Seville Classics Mobile Laundry Hamper Sorter Cart, 3-Bag with Folding Table, Champagne","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SvBhUV-0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your lights, darks, delicates and linens separate with the Seville Classics Deluxe 3-Bag Laundry Hamper Sorter Cart with Folding Table. The lightweight table lifts up for convenient bag removal; it features cotton fabric cover with polyester-foam padding. Use the space to fold freshly laundered linens and clothes, or as a table for pressing wrinkled slacks, pants, shorts, and shirts. Bags are constructed from heavy-duty, machine-washable 100% polyester canvas and provide about 1. 5 cu. ft. of space each. Simply throw the bag into the wash when it's ready! Each bag features dual steel-wire handles dipped in soft-grip material. The base features three steel mesh panels that prevent the bags from sagging when overfull. Swivel wheels allow the cart to move easily; two lock for stability when you need it to stay put. Use it your way: organize colors and whites easily in your bedroom or laundry room; store it in a closet to keep dirty clothes out of sight; roll it from room-to-room when it's time to gather bed sheets and blankets; carry the bags to the laundry mat or the dry cleaners. 100% polyester bags in natural white Lift-up table features a heat-resistant cotton-canvas cover cushioned with polyester-foam padding Iron mesh folding table High-strength oval tube frame provides stability in motion and at rest; champagne epoxy finish Angled steel-wire bag handles coated in champagne soft-grip material Three mesh support panels prevent bags from sagging, stopping premature wear and tear Large, curved handles can be held easily with the folding table down or up Four 3-inch wheels glide easily; two lock when needed Easy assembly with necessary tools included Dimensions: 31. 2\" W x 18. 3\" D x 36. 7\" H Bag dimensions: 14\" W x 8. 5\" D x 23\" H Volume: 1. 3 bushels or 1. 6 cu. ft. per bag Weight capacity: 10 lbs. per bag Weight: 23 lbs. Model #: WEB182","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SvBhUV-0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seville Classics","source_asin":"B00MIOR5M2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MIOR5M2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MIOR5M2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
