window.products.push({"id":457300,"name":"Total 150 pcs /6 Various Dried Pampas Grass Décor, White Pompous Grass, Bunny Tails Dried Flowers Reed Grass, 17 inch Pompass Grass for Flower Arrange","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-sVITt+EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MULTIPLE VARIATIONS in 1: The dried flower bouquet has 6 varieties, come with 150 luxuriant and lush pampas plants, including 30pcs white pampas, 30pcs natural pampas grass, 20pcs white bunny tails pampas grass, 20pcs brown bunny tails, 10pcs white Italian ruscus and 30pcs reed grass. UNIQUE DECOR: Add a small to medium size vase to the dried flowers to finish off any rooms or events. These pampas grass branches with silky and pure soft touch have vibrant look, used for house, office, party, garden, hotel, cafes, festival, celebration, balcony, etc. And you can use our pompous grass for wedding décor. You can DIY boho dry flower arrangements to make your favorite bouquets. HIGHEST QUALITY NATURAL FLOWERS: Our dried Pampas grass mix is made with superior quality, handpicked and naturally dried flowers, being 100% safe and non-toxic. Make sure to check our video or product instruction which explains how to fluff up your pampas, for outstanding results! It looks like fresh flowers, but it does not need much care. FIT ANY VASE: Our beautiful pampas grass decor is about 17.5 inches/45cm tall, suitable for any styles of vases. You also can shorten the length of the pampas grass bouquet to adapt to your own vase, so as to achieve your desired decoration needs. Creating fullness and an interesting texture for your boho home decor. WARM TIPS: Before bringing Pampas grass into your home, please take them out of the package carefully and give each reed a gentle shake and you can put the small pampas grass under the sun for a few hours to make it fluffy before use. OR, after placed in a vase, lightly misted with hairspray to reduce shedding and keep fluffy pampas grass for longer time!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-sVITt+EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glamativity","source_asin":"B0B91Z7KNQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457300","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B91Z7KNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B91Z7KNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
