window.products.push({"id":457323,"name":"Airdown California King Mattress 8 Inch, Memory Foam Mattress in a Box Made in USA, Mattress California King Cool Gel Foam Infused Bamboo Charcoal, Me","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":339.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LzHhYykWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【BETTER QUALITY SLEEP】This memory foam mattress is an all-foam layered design, the comfort layer features the liquid gel foam with egg crate top. It tends to be more responsive and will disperse your weight evenly and stop you from tossing and turning. The premium convoluted foam retains less heat and has less pressure than traditional memory foam, meaning that it is easier on the hips and shoulders. So the california king size mattress maximize the comfort level and improve your sleep quality. 【OPTIMAL SUPPORT FOR YOU】Standing at 8-inch thick, it has 3 layers of high-end foam that help alleviate pressure points but also properly cradle the spine. The Bamboo Charcoal memory foam layer helps eliminate odors and correctly support your body for exceptional pressure relief no matter what sleeping position you are. And you’ll sleep comfortable throughout all seasons, thanks to the charcoal wicking away excess heat and moisture. Wake up delighted every day with this 8 inch mattress california king. 【ALWAYS PUT SAFETY FIRST】You can sleep on this bed mattress with confidence because all our bedding are CertiPUR-US certified to ensure performance and safety. The Fiberglass-Free FR inner cover and the jacquard fabric cover provide you with naturally skin-friendly sleep surface, and no health risks for you and your family. Get the excellent experience of deep sleep at night with this breathable foam mattress. The washable cover's zippered configuration allows you to remove for easy cleaning. 【WELL CONSTRUCTED MATTRESS】Underneath the support layers of the mattress sits 5\" of high-density foam, provides deep compression support and minimizes motion transfer, you will not be disturbed and have a restful sleep. It also serves as the foundation for the layers above and provides greater durability and stability to the mattress for a long-lasting use. The california king mattress works on any solid surface, a wood foundation, box spring, slats, the floor and an adjustable base. 【CAL-KING MATTRESS IN A BOX】The memory foam california king mattresses are packaged as a ready-to-ship bed in a box, which are easy to delivery and set-up. Simply unbox and unroll the mattress, expanding to its original shape within 48-72 hours. We make the durable mattresses in the USA that will last for many years without any sags and dips, whilst offering consistent pressure relief and superior support and comfort. We give you a 10-year guarantee to show you how confident we are.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LzHhYykWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Airdown","source_asin":"B0BCJZWV35","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCJZWV35","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCJZWV35","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
