window.products.push({"id":457354,"name":"Incense Holder Backflow Incense Burner Ceramic Chinese Dragon Incense Burner Aromatherapy Gift Decoration with 10 Free Cones","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lPYVhiHhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"In ancient times, people will often burn deodorant in the wood. Therefore, before the ancients always incense burning furnace, read or play art, cleaning their thought, make them focus. The Backflow Principle: because the density of smoke is heavier than the air density, smoke stream from the high down like a waterfall. Color: brown Material: Ceramic Size: 8.8cm* 8cm*6cm (Length*width*height) Incense species: cone / backflow incense How to Use: Choose a flat, windless place Lit up the top of the backflow cone, burn it fully in case you have to lit it again . Place it on the incense burner, and wait a few minutes, the smog will slowly stream down, a dreamlike waterfall shows. Application of space: tea room,temple,living room,bedroom, office, yoga and so on. Features: fresh air,good sleeping, calm emotions, relieve anxiety,relieve fatigue,and so on.We will send you 10 cone incense for free,so you can enjoy the fun of incense. Package included : 1 * incense burner10 * cone incense Warm Tips: Do not touch the cone by hand after burning！After cones burned, it will leave yellow liquid and ashes on Waterfall  Incense Burner Wash it with water,Naturally dry would be better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lPYVhiHhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YINECO","source_asin":"B07RKR78Q2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457354","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RKR78Q2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RKR78Q2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
