window.products.push({"id":457525,"name":"ZINUS 10 Inch Green Tea Luxe Memory Foam Mattress / Pressure Relieving / CertiPUR-US Certified / Bed-in-a-Box / All-New / Made in USA, Twin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FbD2oMsNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How do we improve one of our most loved mattresses? Innovate and elevate every layer to create a new high performance mattress that's still affordable of course - introducing the all-new Green Tea Luxe Memory Foam Mattress. More is better when it comes to all the great sleep-inducing qualities you love. We infused premium green tea into each and every layer to deliver even more freshness in your mattress night and day. More memory foam in every profile height means more comfort and more sleep. With the just right amount of pressure relief- not too much sink- you’ll sleep with an even more supportive feeling that relieves your achiest joints. No need to worry about overheating as our patented 7-zone ventilation system in the middle layer improves airflow performance, while also adding extra pressure relief beneath areas that need it most, like the shoulders, hips and knees. The finishing touch? A breathable knitted cover for ultra comfortable and refreshing sleep. Shipped straight to your door with a 10-year warranty, we certainly didn’t sleep on improving every single performance layer of this mattress.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FbD2oMsNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zinus","source_asin":"B0B5WJ8P7X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5WJ8P7X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5WJ8P7X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
