window.products.push({"id":457596,"name":"Spice Rack Organizer for Cabinet, 3 Tier Seasoning Rack Organizer, Detachable Countertop Spice Racks, Freestanding Spice Holder Organizer for Countert","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jIhnv4EKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"metal [STURDY AND DURABLE MATERIAL] Our sturdy and durable spice rack is made of high quality iron and coated with a waterproof and rust-proof paint. The strong coated metal allows you to use it for a long time as it does not rust or passivate over time. Thickened frame design and smooth surface design give it the qualities of good load-bearing, non-deforming and easy to clean. The classic black finish makes spice rack organizer look good in most kitchens. [3-TIER LARGE-CAPACITY, SPACE-SAVING] If you have a lot of spices and need to store them neatly, this spice rack is a great choice. The 3-tier design of the spice rack is 16.4\"L x 9.5\"W x 17\"H. Its compact design saves valuable counter space in the kitchen. The first tier can be used to hold flat jars, the second tier can put long, tall bottles, and the bottom tier is suitable for small spice bottles. The large capacity seasoning rack can hold at least 40 spice bottles without deformation. [TILT DESIGN FOR EASY TAKE OUT] The spice rack has reasonable slot spacing, so the spice bottles will not fall or roll. The second layer is designed with a 40 degree tilt, making it easy to take out spices. Unlike other spice racks, our bottom tier features an exclusive 3-tier stepped tilt design. The tilted tiers give you a clear view of all your spice jars, allowing you to quickly find and neatly store them. Easy-to-use spice racks save you time and make your cooking easier and more efficient. [KEEP KITCHEN ORGANIZED] You can place the spice rack anywhere you need it on countertop, cabinets, kitchen, pantry, etc. This spice rack for cabinet is perfect for storing your various spices, small jars, dried food, jelly jars, and more. If you have a compact kitchen and are stuck for spices cluttering up your countertop, our 3-tier spice rack organizer can provide an efficient space utilization solution. Practical spice rack will make your countertop cleanup easier and keep items organized. [EASY TO ASSEMBLE, EXQUISITE PACKAGING] Our seasoning rack is easy to assemble. You can do this in minutes with an included hex key, which is very convenient. The package also includes 4 S-hooks, 4 anti-slip pads, and 1 instruction. All of them are packaged in a beautiful box. This is the ideal gift for family and friends who love to cook. Don't hesitate to take it home! If you have any problems with our spice holder, please feel free to contact us and we will offer you replacements or refunds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jIhnv4EKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Consevisen","source_asin":"B09CTKFWS1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CTKFWS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CTKFWS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
