window.products.push({"id":457676,"name":"Tribesigns Modern Round End Table Set of Two with Thick Wood Top, 20”Sofa Side Table Coffee Table with Unique Black O-Shaped Base, Midcentury Accent T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VAcm52OSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT & STYLISH - Artfully constructed with contemporary elegance in mind, this round end table features a classic vintage wood top supported by an airy but sturdy golden O shaped metal frame. With unique in appearance, this white round side table is very versatile for your home decor. UNIQUE DESIGN - A durable metal frame connected by a overlapped \"O\" shape base design offers a sturdy base with style lines for a contemporary round accent table. Whichever way you look at it, this white coffee table creates a geometric aesthetic that will add a touch of color to your room. MULTIPLE FUNCTIONS - The small table can be used as coffee table, cocktail table, end table, sofa table, nightstand etc. The rustic brown veneer table top is smooth and easy to clean, waterproof, scratch resistant and high temperature resistant. Smooth rounded tables reduce the risk of injury and protect children from accidental injuries while playing happily in the home. PREMIUM MATERIAL - Made of thick steel frame construction and premium quality MDF board makes the side table durable and sturdy to hold up to 220 lbs for years of worry-free use. Designed with non-marring foot bottom, the end table protects floors from scuffs, scratches and other potential damages. Meanwhile the non-slip rubber feet pads under base can keep the table balance on the uneven floor. ASSEMBLY&100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - Coming with labeled parts, detailed instructions and all accessories, this end table could be assembled easily. The measurements of the round side table is 19.7'' D x 27'' H, which is convenient to move around as needed. We will provide 18 months' worry-free warranty and friendly customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VAcm52OSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribesigns","source_asin":"B0BRSQQ1HF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRSQQ1HF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRSQQ1HF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
