window.products.push({"id":457711,"name":"POP FIZZ DESIGNS Nashville Bachelorette Party Sashes | 7 Pack | Includes 1 Bride Sash “Getting Hitched” | 6 Funny Bride Tribe Sashes for Bridal Party","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hhh1QB95L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"satin 👢YA’LL CRAZY COWGIRLS READY FOR A NASH BASH? Well, my boot-scootin’ babes, no Nashville bachelorette party is complete without the sassiest Nash sashes this side of Music City! Whether you’re a Southern Belle or a Honkie Tonk Hottie, our hilarious Nashville bach sashes will have your bride tribe yellin’ YEE HAW as you shoot whiskey and line dance the night away to celebrate your favorite cowgirl’s final thrill in Nashville! 👢OUR BLACK AND GOLD SATIN SASHES come in 2 pack sizes. 7 pack includes these FUN PHRASES: 1. Getting Hitched 2. Maid of Dishonor 3. Whiskey Girl 4. Honkey Tonk Hottie 5. Southern Belle 6. 100% Cowgirl 7. Booty Dancer. 12 pack includes all fo the above PLUS: 8. Cowboy Catcher 9. Shot Queen 10. Partner in Crime 11. Rhinestone Rebel 12. Country Star. Comes with safety pins to avoid any oopsie-daisies! 👢WE KNOW YA’LL ARE HIGH-QUALITY COWGIRLS, that’s why our Cowgirl bachelorette sashes are too! Each black satin sash is silk-screened printed by hand with premium gold glitter to make your bride tribe POP and BLING brighter than any other bachelorette bash on Broadway. Other boring sashes don’t stand a chance to our HILARIOUS, HIGH-QUALITY sashes that will make all your Nashville decor dreams come true! 👢SKIP EXPENSIVE SHIRTS and STAND OUT from other basic bachelorettes. With our FUNNY and FABULOUS sashes, you can show your bride tribe pride at a fraction of the price. So, what are ya’ll waitin’ for? Time to sash up and kick off the BEST honky tonk bachelorette hoedown Nashville has ever seen! 👢 AT POP FIZZ DESIGNS, FUN is our middle name. We’re a small family business & believe life was meant to be celebrated – every moment. WE LOVE HELPING CUSTOMERS TO make their celebration special. IF, FOR ANY REASON, you don’t absolutely love your Nashville bachelorette sashes, WE WILL MAKE IT RIGHT","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hhh1QB95L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pop Fizz Designs","source_asin":"B081VBNLBP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081VBNLBP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081VBNLBP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
