window.products.push({"id":457854,"name":"Moe's Home Collection 31.5-Inch Torno Coffee Table, Dark Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FM-fsoySL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Round coffee table. We are a is a family-owned company with roots in Washington state and Vancouver, BC. We have been guided by a unique and valuable philosophy; take care of our customers and they’ll return the favor. Whether you're looking for a centerpiece for a distinctive room, quality art work for walls/room, or furniture to make a statement, look to us. Unique home furnishings have been selectively designed and inspired by trips to to Saigon, Jakarta, and Beijing. The upscale collections caters to those with an eye for detail and the unusual. As designers go, we are one-stop-shopping; from our on-trend distressed pieces to transitional to modern, there is a piece for everyone. All media is used in our crafting; we are integratingreclaimed wood in recognition of the importance of the environment. A bonus to all is that we bring you quality, unique fashion and style at affordable prices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FM-fsoySL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moe's Home Collection","source_asin":"B06Y495HCR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y495HCR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y495HCR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":457855,"name":"Lone Wolf Silhouette Howling at Moon Night Sky Photo Wolf Posters for Walls Posters Wolves Print Posters Art Wolf Wall Decor Nature Posters Wolf Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kF-X8V+mL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Poster measures 12x18 inches (31x46 cm) and ideal size for any standard 12x18 frame. Lightweight and low-glare satin finish paper creates photo quality poster art for your home decor. All poster prints are carefully rolled and packed. MAKES A GREAT GIFT - Whether you need a special gift for friends or family or looking for yourself, our wall poster is suitable for living room decor, bedroom wall art, bathroom decor and office posters wall decoration. This cool wall art will light up your home, it is the modern way to brighten up any space, each and every piece comes with its own unique story. We believe in delivering impeccable quality prints that last a lifetime. MADE IN THE USA and OFFICIALLY LICENSED - This poster is professionally printed in the USA on premium acid-free paper for a high color aesthetic and years of fade resistant enjoyment of your artwork. The attractive images come from our vast curated collection of officially licensed and custom designed art prints. EASY TO HANG - Wall decor posters are easy to hang in a variety of ways. Our posters ship professionally rolled in a sturdy tube and you can use tape or putty or pins or poster hangers or poster frames to hang them on your wall. You can also laminate them to create door signs or a dry erase sign for your bulletin board. COOL WOLF STUFF FOR WOLF LOVERS - Wolves are carnivorous animals found around the world. A wolf is similar to foxes and a less domesticated version of dogs. Wolves are considered wild animals and live in various forest wooded mountainous and rocky terrains. A group of wolves is a pack. A quality product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kF-X8V+mL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poster Foundry","source_asin":"B0C5B7DX4L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5B7DX4L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5B7DX4L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":457856,"name":"CAKESAFE Bare Necessities Cake Decorating Acrylic Disk Kit – 3 Sets -Round 4.5”, 6.5” and 8.5” Disk Sets (2 disks per size), 2-8\" Icing Scrapers with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C6ALmPmgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The CakeSafe Bare Necessities Kit contains Acrylic Disk sizes 4\", 6” and 8”along with an 8” Quad Icing Scraper. Use this Disk Kit to create sharp edges and smooth finishes on all of your cakes! The perimeter size of this Bare Necessities Kit is .5”. The .5” Acrylic Disks will allow for ¼” of icing all around your baked cake. This amount of icing is most popular for bakers who make all buttercream cakes and don’t cover with fondant. In order to determine which size Acrylic Disk is best for your cake, measure your finished cakes and the bottom of your cake pans before ordering. Our general rule of thumb when it comes to choosing the best size Acrylic Disk is: 5\" sizing: For cakes that shrink LESS than 1/8\" (or not at all,) AND you are NOT planning to cover with fondant (.5\" IS THE SIZING YOU ARE RECEIVING WHEN ORDERING THIS PRODUCT) .25\" sizing: For cakes that shrink MORE than 1/8\" OR your cakes do not shrink, but you are planning to cover with fondant .00\" sizing: For cakes that shrink MORE than 1/4\" OR your cakes do not shrink and you are designing a “naked” cake The 3/8\" center hole in all of our Acrylic Disks help bakers to center their cake tiers on the disks by using a temporary dowel as they ice. If you do not chill your cakes before icing with the disks, you can put a temporary dowel through the disks and cake to make sure your layers do not shift. The center holes do not affect the performance of the disks, should you choose not to use them. In addition to the 3 sets of Acrylic Disks, this Bare Necessities kit comes with 2 8” Icing Scrapers, with 1 straight edge for perfect smooth sides and 3 Cake Comb patterns for beautiful detailed designs on your cakes. Bakers prefer CakeSafe’s Icing Scrapers because they are clear so you can see what's happening to your icing on the other side of the scraper as you're working. Handle with care. Hand wash with mild soap.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C6ALmPmgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAKESAFE","source_asin":"B08L28Y54Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L28Y54Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L28Y54Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":457857,"name":"Department 56 Snow Village Halloween Grimsly's House of Oddities Building","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R1SSYortS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Owned and operated by the first family of the Snow Village Halloween, the \"Grimsly's House of Oddities\" is a place to visit not only on Halloween but all year long! This lit building gives the collector a sneak peak at some of the exits inside in the \"break-out\" windows in front and on the side. Designed and manufactured exclusively by Department 56. Amazon.com An eerie member of the Snow Village Halloween collection by Department 56, Grimsly's House of Oddities promises three stories of spooky surprises--some of which burst from the windows to scare anyone who dares to approach. The exceptionally well-detailed ceramic building features a decaying brick and stone façade, intimidating gargoyles, barren trees, and interior lights that glow through every window. Three sides also have \"break-out\" windows showcasing especially frightful exhibits such as a caged man and escaping monster. This spooky museum makes a fun start to a new Halloween village or a fittingly frightful complement to a seasoned collector's set. It measures 7-3/4 inches wide by 6 inches deep by 10 inches high and includes an adapter cord. Packaged in an original Snow Village Halloween box; introduced in 2008. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R1SSYortS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B0014MGH0K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457857","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0014MGH0K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0014MGH0K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
