window.products.push({"id":457884,"name":"KOUBOO 1030066 Laguna Round Rattan Hamper with Liner, 18\" x 18\" x 22\", Black Wash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wfRKvl8rL._AC_.jpg","description":"This round rattan hamper will keep laundry out of sight in a naturally beautiful container. Hand woven from rattan in Hapao style, this black antique hamper features a removable, machine-washable, cotton liner to protect your clothes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wfRKvl8rL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kouboo","source_asin":"B016COH5NC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016COH5NC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016COH5NC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":457885,"name":"Peugeot Zephir Electric Soft Touch 5.5 Inch Pepper Mill, Basalte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31dmTqVi-fL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Advantage of Freshly Ground Spices There are many benefits to freshly grinding pepper, salt, herbs and spices for cooking and seasoning. A quality mill with a specifically designed grinding mechanism will release the aromas and essential oils of that spice. Freshly ground pepper and spices have more aroma and better flavor than pre- ground. Another advantage of using freshly ground spices or minerals (salts) is the control a mill provides for determining the coarseness (size) of a grind. A high quality pepper, salt or spice mill gives you the ability to choose and change the coarseness according to taste or necessity. How to Choose a Good Mill When looking for a pepper, salt or spice grinder, consider the following: Grinding mechanism: Choose a grinding mechanism that can withstand daily use: one that is well made and produces a consistent grind. Ideally, the grinding mechanism should be designed to handle a specific spice, as each spice has different physical characteristics that will benefit from different design features. Design and appearance: Whether it's traditional or modern, manual or electric, a mill can be an indispensable tool in your kitchen and a beautiful part of table decor. Ease of Use: A quality mill should be easy to adjust, easy to fill, and feel comfortable in the hand. History of Peugeot Peugeot's story starts in the 19th century when the Peugeot brothers converted the family's gristmill into a steel foundry. They began producing award winning hand tools immediately after opening and went on to produce a diverse range of exceptional quality products including small appliances, bicycles and most notably, automobiles. (Although now operating as a separate company, the Peugeot car company continues the same commitment to quality and innovation that is a Peugeot hallmark). In 1840 Peugeot created their burr style coffee grinder and adopted that design to accommodate peppercorns in 1874. The resulting pepper mechanism design is still used today in every Peugeot pepper mill. Peugeot's iconic pepper grinding mechanism design is often copied, but never equaled. Today, Peugeot offers six unique spice-specific mechanisms plus the original burr-style coffee grinder. There are no shortcuts: each mechanism is designed to get the most out of the spices they are intended for. After more than 160 years, Peugeot mills and grinders remain the benchmark of the industry and have earned their position as the mill of choice in world class kitchens. It's All About the Mechanism The primary difference between Peugeot and all other brands are the spice-specific mechanisms. Peugeot has 7 unique spice specific mechanisms for pepper, salt, herbs and spices, coffee, wet salt, chili peppers and nutmeg. For each spice, there is one - and only one - Peugeot grinding mechanism, each made of the ideal design and constructed from the best material available for its intended use. All Peugeot mechanisms are made in France and carry a lifetime limited warranty. Peugeot's Pepper Grinding Mechanism is a two stage burr-style system. During production, the helix-shaped grooves and grinding teeth of the pepper mechanism are individually cut before the steel is case hardened to make it virtually indestructible. The mechanism is then given a proprietary treatment to provide additional protection against corrosion. During use, the helix- shaped grooves guide whole peppercorns through the mechanism to crack, then grind to a consistent size by a double row of teeth. This process releases the pepper's essential oils, resulting in more flavor and aroma for your dish. This patented mechanism is found on every Peugeot Pepper mill and is widely considered the best pepper mechanism available Peugeot's Salt Crushing Mechanism features two ribbed plates which work to fracture and crush coarse, dry sea salt to a consistent size. The salt grinding mechanism is made of corrosion resistant Stainless Steel, and is found on every Peugeot Salt Mill. Peugeot's Spice Mechanism is made of ceramic, and is specially designed to grind dried spices and flat leafy herbs to release their essential oils. It is particularly effective with dried aromatic herbs such as thyme, parsley, basil, oregano, and herbs de Provence, as well as dried seeds such as cumin. Peugeot's Chili Pepper Mechanism is made of case hardened steel for optimal hardness and resilience. This patented mechanism features a pre-cutting system and dual chamber reservoir. For use with dry, hot chilis such as birds tongue, African devils and Piri Piri. The Nutmeg Shaving Mechanism is made of treated stainless steel which is corrosion resistant, and offers superior edge retention. The Peugeot nutmeg shaver is equipped with a double stainless steel grater blade and a strong claw which enables the whole nutmeg to be very finely shaved, while keeping fingers safe. Intended for use with whole nutmeg nuts. Peugeot's Wet Salt mechanism has been specially designed for wet sea salt: ","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31dmTqVi-fL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peugeot","source_asin":"B000J163J2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000J163J2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000J163J2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":457886,"name":"SunTime US Army Wall Clock Dimension Art 11.5\" Home Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.93,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T0oqdM6EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dimension Wall Clock by Suntime Demonstrate your Army Pride in your home or office with the Official Army Logo. These 11.5 inch Dimension Wall Clocks feature a battery-powered (1xAA battery not included) quartz accurate movement. Unlike plastic wall clocks, you experience superior visibility with our mineral glass crystal. The printed ring on the crystal displays the numbers with a school color-coordinated outer bezel. Clock Measures: 11.5\" x 11.5\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T0oqdM6EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SunTime","source_asin":"B09TRRRWJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TRRRWJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TRRRWJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":457887,"name":"Airdown 10 Inch Queen Mattress, Green Tea Memory Foam Mattress, Medium Firm, Bed-in-a-Box, CertiPUR-US Certified, Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FdHkdmKgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Green Tea & Cooling Gel Infused Provides A Refreshing Sleep - This queen mattress is made of adaptable AeroFusion memory foam that is breathable and cool to the touch to keep you comfortable all night long. With the green tea extracts absorbing moisture and odor-free will give you a whole night fresh experience. Pressure Relieving Foams - Green tea AeroFusiom memory foam is generously infused with a cooling gel. It keeps all of the positive properties of memory foam, like contouring and conforming to the sleeper, while mitigating temperature issues with the gel infusion. 6 inches flex support foam base to provide spinal support to keep your muscles relaxed. This 8-inch memory foam mattress ideal for back sleepers, side sleepers and stomach sleepers. Graphene Fabric Cover - A soft graphene fabric provide elevated comfort and agility. With the removable and machine washable mattress cover which means you can clean it effortless and sleep on it comfortably, and can keep your mattress fresher and cleaner and better increase your mattress life. CertiPUR-US Certified - Our queen size memory foam mattresses are manufactured in the US. The memory foam and fabrics have been independently safety tested, this high-grade foam is CertiPUR US Certified for durability, performance, and content. Smartly Shipped - Bed in a box, this mattress is expertly compressed and rolled into a compact box delivered right to your door for easy setup. Simply unbox it, cut the plastic wrap, and the mattress will expand to its original shape within 48-72 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FdHkdmKgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Airdown","source_asin":"B0BNBGB6DL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-457887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNBGB6DL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNBGB6DL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
